1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,655
Most messy fades come from one mistake:

2
00:00:02,675 --> 00:00:04,630
going too high, too fast.

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:07,093
Here's a clean low fade in five steps.

4
00:00:07,113 --> 00:00:08,767
Step one. Set your guide.

5
00:00:08,787 --> 00:00:10,392
Clippers open, no guard.

6
00:00:10,412 --> 00:00:12,305
Cut a line about an inch above the ear,

7
00:00:12,325 --> 00:00:13,718
all the way around the back.

8
00:00:13,738 --> 00:00:15,480
Step two. Number one guard.

9
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,517
Start below the line

10
00:00:16,537 --> 00:00:17,642
and flick out just above it

11
00:00:17,662 --> 00:00:18,868
with a scooping motion.

12
00:00:18,888 --> 00:00:20,000
Step three. Number two guard.
